GUIDE
-----

`examples/incidents.csv` and `examples/classifications.csv` are organisation
479 of `GUIDE_Train.csv` from GUIDE, the Microsoft Security Incident
Prediction dataset (Microsoft, 2024), cut by `bench/slice.py`. The
classifications of the last three days are moved from the first file to the
second, and GUIDE's placeholder ids for missing values are left blank.

